From: René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>
Subject: [PATCH] add i860 port

Static and dynamic linking, TLS through r30, lock and unlock atomics, optimized memcpy, memmove and memset.

Against upstream commit 7813e9119eb5fe681b6750b8a033a0490bca0941 (regex: avoid int overflow in regcomp).
Branch i860 at 4e2d57a5. Tested in the MAME magicst2 model only, not on real hardware.

Signed-off-by: René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
